@startuml usecase-01-storyboard-direct
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam wrapWidth 170
title Use case 1 — storyboard-direct\n"use the chat as-is, ask the image model for N pictures in one go (no planning)"

actor User
participant "IllustrateDialog" as DLG
participant "ChatNodeComponent\nillustrate()" as UI
participant "LlmUseCaseRunner\n(env builder)" as RUN
participant "storyboardDirect\n(controller)" as UC
participant "LlmOrchestratorService\ncompleteImage()" as ORCH
participant "LlmTransportService\ncompletion + images" as XPORT
participant "Evaluators" as EVAL
participant "LlmLogService" as LOG
participant "LlmPostprocessorService\nplan() / apply()" as POST
participant "ChatService" as SVC
participant "Provider\n(proxy)" as NET

== 1. Dialog picks the use case ==
User -> DLG : count(>1), planDescriptions OFF, style, storyboard rules
DLG --> UI : options
UI -> UI : pickUsecase(vars) → 'storyboard-direct'\nbeginOperation('illustrate') → Stop ends the use case
note over UI, RUN
  vars carry count, style, storyboardPrompt,\ncontent (scene text), modelId, providerId.
end note

== 2. Run: env built once per run ==
UI -> RUN : runner.run(chat, node, usecase, vars)
RUN -> RUN : resolveImageModel(modelId, providerId)\ninstruction = styled task prompt\ncontextMessages = text-only chat up to node\nanchor = instruction + node text\nimageExtras (stream:false)
RUN --> UC : controllerFor('storyboard-direct')(env)

== 3. Controller: one render request ==
UC -> UC : oneShotStoryboardPrompt(anchor, [], count, storyboardPrompt)\n→ the full chat + "render N consistent scenes"
UC -> ORCH : completeImage(cx, request, { expect:'images', prompt, signal })
ORCH -> XPORT : completeImage(request) — rawCompletion with\nmodalities for image models + fallback tree
XPORT -> LOG : record({ kind:'chat', body })
XPORT -> NET : POST /chat/completions (stream:false)
XPORT -> LOG : complete(entry, { response })
XPORT --> ORCH : raw JSON

== 4. Evaluate ==
ORCH -> EVAL : evaluateImagesResponse(raw)
EVAL --> ORCH : images slot (ok | partial | refused, reason)
ORCH --> UC : EvalSlots

== 5. Wrap + place — IMMEDIATELY as pictures arrive ==
UC -> POST : storyboard slot (1 scene = all N images,\nor N refused scenes on moderation)
POST -> POST : plan(slots) → illustration-1..N + prompt-1.txt\n(every picture is attached to the chapter node as\nsoon as it is created — not after the whole generation)
POST -> SVC : editAssistant(chapter, attachments)\n(versioned) — on the node illustrate was called for
POST --> UI : activate(chapter.id)
note over UI, POST
  count>1 && got<want → alert "only got X of Y scenes";\nzero images → alert empty with model reply.\nOne Stop press ends the use case (isOperationCancelled)\n— pictures already attached stay on the node.
end note

@enduml